# OZONE world - Sektor_02_MegacityGrid
# Sefirah 1 - Terran Prime. Dense urban signal relays.
#
# INTENT
#   Fantasy: the city is a machine and you are walking through the wiring.
#   Two districts: the crossroads where the grid is still inhabited, and the
#   relay plaza beyond the gate where the machine itself stands.
#   One moment: stepping out of the south avenue into the crossroads with the
#   rail deck overhead and the relay tower standing above the north gate -
#   the next district visible over the wall before you reach it.
#
#   Pacing arc:
#     0:00  READ       south avenue, deck + tower ahead, no threat in reach
#     0:30  PRESSURE   crossroads skirmish behind the newsstand
#     1:30  FLANK      relay hall (racks, one door) or the substation dead end
#     2:30  REWARD     deck climb: rifle + an overview of every route
#     3:00  OPTIONAL   market roof: grass, coin, a brute - pure choice
#     4:00  GATE       the north gate: the plaza opens up, tower overhead
#     5:00  DISTRICT   relay plaza: arcade west, vault east, tower centre
#     6:00  CLIMB      ring deck (10) -> tower top (20) under the stairs' own
#                      fire, with the vault and arcade still to clear below
#     7:00  EXIT       the tower top
#
#   Flow:  south avenue -> crossroads -> relay hall / substation / market roof
#                      -> rail deck (optional) -> NORTH GATE
#                      -> relay plaza -> arcade (west) | vault (east)
#                      -> ring deck -> tower top -> EXIT
#
#   Two independent routes through district B: the plaza floor (arcade, vault,
#   tower base) and the high route (stair -> ring deck -> tower top). The high
#   route skips the plaza, so clearing it is a choice, not a corridor.
#
# GEOMETRY NOTES
#   Floor z=0 in both districts. Deck underside 5.5, hall ceiling 8, arcade
#   canopy 6.0. Ring deck 10, tower top 19.9, every stair tread rises 1.0.
#   Tower is a solid cylinder (r=8, top 19.9) with an external-ring deck; the
#   last stair tread tops at 20.0 so it never shares a plane with the tower.
#
# Format: ozone v1.0  (Z-up: x=east, y=north, z=up)

# ============================================================================
# Geometry
# ============================================================================
# ==========================================================================
# DISTRICT A - the crossroads. Ground z=0, four 16-wide avenues.
